# L0 = Box. Two families are called directly, each at a place of its own: each pool is tied. One of the first five, reached only there, lets them meet: the pools are tied to one while nobody has asked a name of either. The call by name is reached later still, through a third family: the pool that is kept answers for the functions that were tied to the other.
